       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\n- **Order as written:** 1600 mg four times daily is 6,400 mg/day.\n- **Maximum dose:** The usual maximum for adults is 3,200 mg/day, and that is for prescription use under supervision. Single doses are normally capped at 800 mg.\n- **Risk:** This order is double the daily maximum. It raises the risk of GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and cardiovascular events.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **800 mg by mouth four times daily:** This is 3,200 mg/day, the maximum.\n- **600 mg by mouth four times daily:** This is 2,400 mg/day.\n- **400 mg by mouth every 6 hours:** This is 1,600 mg/day, and it's a common dose for pain or inflammation.\n- **1600 mg total per day:** This could be 400 mg four times daily, or 800 mg twice daily.\n\nTell me the dose and frequency you want, and I'll enter it. If you really want 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm that and give a clinical reason. I can add that to the order note."
